# Project Rules

## Memory Bank Protocol
At the start of EVERY new task, read these files in order before doing anything else:
1. memory-bank/projectbrief.md
2. memory-bank/activeContext.md
3. memory-bank/progress.md

If memory-bank/ doesn't exist, create it with these files based on exploring 
the codebase, and ask me to confirm the details.

## Update Protocol
At the end of any task with meaningful progress (new feature, bug fix, 
architectural decision, deployment change), update memory-bank/activeContext.md 
and memory-bank/progress.md to reflect what changed. Do this automatically 
without asking permission.
